{"id":"73270f29098db683","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation.md","title":"Prime-Base Concatenation Is Constructive Arithmetic","display":"thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation — Prime-Base Concatenation Is Constructive Arithmetic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation"],"display":"thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation — Prime-Base Concatenation Is Constructive Arithmetic","source":"第 IV 章 p. 43，Proposition A（PDF 60）","source_status":"原书 Proposition A 的边界修正","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]]","[[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation — Prime-Base Concatenation Is Constructive Arithmetic"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章 p. 43，Proposition A（PDF 60）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书 Proposition A 的边界修正"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17f36b05a2fd2754\" href=\"?note=17f36b05a2fd2754\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power\">92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e9af284cd2d6f1aa\" href=\"?note=e9af284cd2d6f1aa\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-concatenation\">92-df-smullyan-concatenation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\geq2\">\\(p\\geq2\\)</span> 为素数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"*_p\">\\(*_p\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e9af284cd2d6f1aa\" href=\"?note=e9af284cd2d6f1aa\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-concatenation\">92-df-smullyan-concatenation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Scale}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Scale}_p\\)</span> 为上一节点的唯一位长幂关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cat}_p\">\\(\\operatorname{Cat}_p\\)</span> 为下文定义的三元图关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}prime\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n(x=0\\land z=y)\\lor\n[x&gt;0\\land\\exists u\\leq z\\;\\exists v\\leq z\\;\n(\\operatorname{Scale}_p(y,u)\\land v=x\\cdot u\\land v+y=z)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow x*_p y=z,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}prime\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n(x=0\\land z=y)\\lor\n[x&gt;0\\land\\exists u\\leq z\\;\\exists v\\leq z\\;\n(\\operatorname{Scale}_p(y,u)\\land v=x\\cdot u\\land v+y=z)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p(x,y,z)&amp;\\leftrightarrow x*_p y=z,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>当 x&gt;0 时，u 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^{\\ell_p(y)}\">\\(p^{\\ell_p(y)}\\)</span>，v=xu，z=v+y，故 u≤v≤z；原书的 bounded witnesses 此时正确。当 x=0 时 z=y，但 u&gt;y=z，不能限制 u≤z，因此必须单独列零左因子。</p>\n<p>最小反例：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0*_p0=0\">\\(0*_p0=0\\)</span>，而直接使用原书两个见证都 ≤z 的公式，会要求正数 p≤0。本节点修复的是有界显示式，不改数学上的拼接定义。通过语法规范化，整个关系只使用原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span> 原子与变量界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power","status":"resolved","id":"17f36b05a2fd2754","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"e9af284cd2d6f1aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-concatenation","status":"resolved","id":"e9af284cd2d6f1aa","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p\\geq2$ 为素数，$x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N$；$*_p$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-concatenation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"*_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Scale}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cat}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}prime\\text{-}concatenation}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p(x,y,z)&\\leftrightarrow\n(x=0\\land z=y)\\lor\n[x>0\\land\\exists u\\leq z\\;\\exists v\\leq z\\;\n(\\operatorname{Scale}_p(y,u)\\land v=x\\cdot u\\land v+y=z)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p(x,y,z)&\\leftrightarrow x*_p y=z,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Cat}_p\\in\\mathcal R_E^{0,3}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p^{\\ell_p(y)}","display":false},{"tex":"0*_p0=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false}],"bytes":1673,"backlinks":[{"id":"e095d63f890051fd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f990aa46292ead55","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e9af284cd2d6f1aa","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第 IV 章在素数底下进一步给出构造算术图，见 [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]]。该节点显式修正原书 bounded 显示式的零左因子边界；不能无条件把位长幂见证限制到最终值之内。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-30","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"无指数算术化：[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]] → [[92-df-smullyan-divisibility-prime-power]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]] → [[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]] → [[92-df-smullyan-frames]] → [[92-df-smullyan-finite-pair-code]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-finite-set-lemma]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-314","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-prime-concatenation]]"}],"outgoing":["17f36b05a2fd2754","e9af284cd2d6f1aa"]}